{"id":"ws1-an8-39","title":"mahādānāni","titleEn":"Great Gifts","ref":"AN 8.39","source":"Pāḷi Workshop booklet · page 14","credit":"Pāḷi text and English translation as in Mor’s Pāḷi Workshop booklet.","section":"extra","collection":"workshop","group":"1 · sīla, dāna & saddhā","groupSub":"And Other Wholesome Qualities","paras":[{"t":[["“"],["pañc’imāni","pañc’imāni"],[","],[" "],["bhikkhave","bhikkhave"],[","],[" "],["dānāni","dānāni"],[","],[" "],["mahā-dānāni","mahā-dānāni"],[","],[" "],["aggaññāni","aggaññāni"],[","],["\n"],["rattaññāni","rattaññāni"],[","],[" "],["vaṃsaññāni","vaṃsaññāni"],[","],[" "],["porāṇāni","porāṇāni"],[","],[" "],["asaṃkiṇṇāni","asaṃkiṇṇāni"],[","],["\n"],["asaṃkiṇṇapubbāni","asaṃkiṇṇapubbāni"],[","],[" "],["na","na"],[" "],["saṃkiyanti","saṃkiyanti"],[" "],["na","na"],[" "],["saṃkiyissanti","saṃkiyissanti"],[","],["\n"],["appaṭikuṭṭhāni","appaṭikuṭṭhāni"],[" "],["samaṇehi","samaṇehi"],[" "],["brāhmaṇehi","brāhmaṇehi"],[" "],["viññūhi","viññūhi"],["."]],"en":"“There are, bhikkhus, these five gifts, great gifts,\nprimal, of long standing, traditional, ancient,\nunsullied and never before sullied,\nwhich are not being sullied, and will not be sullied,\nnot rejected by wise ascetics and brahmins.","lines":true},{"t":[["katamāni","katamāni"],[" "],["pañca","pañca"],["?"],[" "],["idha","idha"],[","],[" "],["bhikkhave","bhikkhave"],[","],[" "],["ariya-sāvako","ariya-sāvako"],[" "],["pāṇ’ātipātaṃ","pāṇ’ātipātaṃ"],["\n"],["pahāya","pahāya"],[","],[" "],["pāṇ’ātipātā","pāṇ’ātipātā"],[" "],["paṭivirato","paṭivirato"],[" "],["hoti","hoti"],["."],[" "],["pāṇ’ātipātā","pāṇ’ātipātā"],[" "],["paṭivirato","paṭivirato"],[","],["\n"],["bhikkhave","bhikkhave"],[","],[" "],["ariya-sāvako","ariya-sāvako"],[" "],["aparimāṇānaṃ","aparimāṇānaṃ"],[" "],["sattānaṃ","sattānaṃ"],["\n"],["abhayaṃ","abhayaṃ"],[" "],["deti","deti"],[","],[" "],["averaṃ","averaṃ"],[" "],["deti","deti"],[","],[" "],["abyābajjhaṃ","abyābajjhaṃ"],[" "],["deti","deti"],["."]],"en":"What five? Here, a noble disciple, having abandoned\nthe destruction of life, abstains from the destruction\nof life. By abstaining from the destruction of life,\nthe noble disciple gives to an immeasurable number\nof beings freedom from fear, enmity, and affliction.","lines":true},{"t":[["aparimāṇānaṃ","aparimāṇānaṃ"],[" "],["sattānaṃ","sattānaṃ"],[" "],["abhayaṃ","abhayaṃ"],[" "],["datvā","datvā"],[","],[" "],["averaṃ","averaṃ"],[" "],["datvā","datvā"],[","],["\n"],["abyābajjhaṃ","abyābajjhaṃ"],[" "],["datvā","datvā"],[","],[" "],["aparimāṇassa","aparimāṇassa"],[" "],["abhayassa","abhayassa"],[" "],["averassa","averassa"],["\n"],["abyābajjhassa","abyābajjhassa"],[" "],["bhāgī","bhāgī"],[" "],["hoti","hoti"],["."],["\n"],["idaṃ","idaṃ"],[","],[" "],["bhikkhave","bhikkhave"],[","],[" "],["paṭhamaṃ","paṭhamaṃ"],[" "],["dānaṃ","dānaṃ"],[" "],["mahā-dānaṃ","mahā-dānaṃ"],[" "],["..."],[" "],["pe","pe"],[" "],["..."]],"en":"Having given to an immeasurable number of beings\nfreedom from fear, enmity, and affliction,\nhe himself in turn enjoys immeasurable freedom\nfrom fear, enmity, and affliction.\nThis is the first gift, a great gift ...","lines":true},{"t":[["puna","puna"],[" "],["caparaṃ","caparaṃ"],[","],[" "],["bhikkhave","bhikkhave"],[","],[" "],["ariya-sāvako","ariya-sāvako"],[" "],["adinn’ādānaṃ","adinn’ādānaṃ"],[" "],["pahāya","pahāya"],["\n"],["..."],[" "],["pe","pe"],[" "],["..."],[" "],["kāmesu","kāmesu"],[" "],["micchā-cāraṃ","micchā-cāraṃ"],[" "],["pahāya","pahāya"],[" "],["..."],[" "],["pe","pe"],[" "],["..."],["\n"],["musā-vādaṃ","musā-vādaṃ"],[" "],["pahāya","pahāya"],[" "],["..."],[" "],["pe","pe"],[" "],["..."],["\n"],["surā-meraya-majja-pamāda-ṭṭhānaṃ","surā-meraya-majja-pamāda-ṭṭhānaṃ"],[" "],["pahāya","pahāya"],[","],["\n"],["surā-meraya-majja-pamāda-ṭṭhānā","surā-meraya-majja-pamāda-ṭṭhānā"],[" "],["paṭivirato","paṭivirato"],[" "],["hoti","hoti"],["."],["\n"],["surā-meraya-majja-pamāda-ṭṭhānā","surā-meraya-majja-pamāda-ṭṭhānā"],[" "],["paṭivirato","paṭivirato"],[","],[" "],["bhikkhave","bhikkhave"],[","],["\n"],["ariya-sāvako","ariya-sāvako"],[" "],["aparimāṇānaṃ","aparimāṇānaṃ"],[" "],["sattānaṃ","sattānaṃ"],[" "],["abhayaṃ","abhayaṃ"],[" "],["deti","deti"],[","],["\n"],["averaṃ","averaṃ"],[" "],["deti","deti"],[","],[" "],["abyābajjhaṃ","abyābajjhaṃ"],[" "],["deti","deti"],["."]],"en":"Again, a noble disciple, having abandoned the taking\nof what is not given, abstains from taking what is not\ngiven … abstains from sexual misconduct … abstains\nfrom false speech … abstains from liquor, wine, and\nintoxicants, the basis for negligence.\nBy abstaining from liquor, wine, and intoxicants,\nthe basis for negligence, the noble disciple gives\nto an immeasurable number of beings freedom\nfrom fear, enmity, and affliction.","lines":true},{"t":[["aparimāṇānaṃ","aparimāṇānaṃ"],[" "],["sattānaṃ","sattānaṃ"],[" "],["abhayaṃ","abhayaṃ"],[" "],["datvā","datvā"],[","],[" "],["averaṃ","averaṃ"],[" "],["datvā","datvā"],[","],["\n"],["abyābajjhaṃ","abyābajjhaṃ"],[" "],["datvā","datvā"],[","],[" "],["aparimāṇassa","aparimāṇassa"],[" "],["abhayassa","abhayassa"],[" "],["averassa","averassa"],["\n"],["abyābajjhassa","abyābajjhassa"],[" "],["bhāgī","bhāgī"],[" "],["hoti","hoti"],["."],[" "],["idaṃ","idaṃ"],[","],[" "],["bhikkhave","bhikkhave"],[","],[" "],["pañcamaṃ","pañcamaṃ"],[" "],["dānaṃ","dānaṃ"],[","],["\n"],["mahā-dānaṃ","mahā-dānaṃ"],[","],[" "],["aggaññaṃ","aggaññaṃ"],[","],[" "],["rattaññaṃ","rattaññaṃ"],[","],[" "],["vaṃsaññaṃ","vaṃsaññaṃ"],[","],[" "],["porāṇaṃ","porāṇaṃ"],["..."],["\n"],["asaṃkiṇṇaṃ","asaṃkiṇṇaṃ"],[","],[" "],["asaṃkiṇṇapubbaṃ","asaṃkiṇṇapubbaṃ"],[","],[" "],["na","na"],[" "],["saṃkiyati","saṃkiyati"],[" "],["na","na"],[" "],["saṃkiyissati","saṃkiyissati"],[","],["\n"],["appaṭikuṭṭhaṃ","appaṭikuṭṭhaṃ"],[" "],["samaṇehi","samaṇehi"],[" "],["brāhmaṇehi","brāhmaṇehi"],[" "],["viññūhi","viññūhi"],[".”"]],"en":"He himself in turn enjoys immeasurable freedom\nfrom fear, enmity, and affliction. This is the fifth